{"id":"wb-7-406","name":"雒城遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"雒城遺址","text":"雒城遗址位于四川省广汉市雒城镇，文物遗址年代判定为汉。1991年4月16日公布为四川省第三批文物保护单位。2013年3月5日列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。现开辟为房湖公园供人参观。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9B%92%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%BA%E5%9D%80","revisionId":87814878,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=87814878","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/602de282d11dfa06b7d18c9c.jpg","title":"雒城遗址国保碑.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%9B%92%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D%E7%A2%91.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ca/%E9%9B%92%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D%E7%A2%91.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Ruins Site of Luocheng City","width":320,"height":179}}